  Effect.sync(() => {
    message.retry();  // No delay!
  })
)
```

## Required Change

Implement exponential backoff based on attempt count:

```typescript
Effect.catchAll((error) => {
  // Differentiate retryable vs non-retryable
  if (isNonRetryable(error)) {
    return Effect.sync(() => message.ack());
  }

  // Exponential backoff: 30, 900, 27000, capped at 43200 (12 hours)
  const delay = Math.min(30 * Math.pow(30, message.attempts - 1), 43200);

  return Effect.sync(() => {
    message.retry({ delaySeconds: delay });
  });
})
```

